# Virtue of Persistence: "At the beginning of your upkeep, put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under
# your control." Cast from hand on turn 1 with Black Lotus and four Moxen. In turn 2 Bot2 kills its two Ornithopters with
# two Lightning Bolts, so Bot2's graveyard holds two creature cards and two instants. At Bot1's turn 3 upkeep a Bolt is refused
# as a target (it is not a creature card) beside an Ornithopter from Bot2's graveyard, not Bot1's, the legal target, which
# enters under Bot1's control (CR 110.2a) though Bot2 owns it; the second Ornithopter stays in the graveyard.

